96: 
97: **The obligation.**  Gate 2's `SC_EXEMPT` carried `wdc_identify` to 2026-09-27; from 09-28 its "no exemption is past its
98: dated deadline" row reds on every run.  **Owner ruling 2026-09-25 (row `scexempt`): FIX it -- and on scope, "24/128
